ngs as kind of side projects almost  right and and not everybody knows about  that and then being able to to think  through all of it together and pull it  together is is something that we enjoy  doing  well thank you very much for your  efforts to pull all this together it's  one of the things we talk about a lot  how do you measure  environmental and sustainable  sustainability performance and the  methodologies that you have and the  transparency you're using are a big help  in in giving people something to which  to react to say wow great or geez i  think i could make that better in  various ways or whatever so if you all  would join me in thanking emma for a  time with us
 

